+### 1111 — M1 integration remains isolated from the legacy SwiftPM release lane (TASK-260715-3qqbbm)
+- BOUNDARY: The accepted `ReluxProxy` v0.1.0 SwiftPM package, `works.relux.proxy` defaults domain, product paths, and `ReluxProxy.dmg` release entries remain owned by the separate legacy repository. Generated M1 products use `ReluxProxyMac.app`, `works.relux.tunnel.mac`, `works.relux.tunnel.mac.tunnel`, and Keychain service `works.relux.tunnel.credential.v1`; they do not define or link an exact legacy product identity.
