 ### 0825 — M0-bound macOS and deterministic harness runtime factories (TASK-260715-3ejhyy)
 - IMPLEMENTATION: The macOS production call site validates the exact accepted manifest SHA-256 and semantic evidence before any component closure runs, derives the accepted packet/HEV/SSH values from that manifest, and creates one fresh coordinator graph per generation. The graph selects `LibSSH2TransportFactory`, the system-domain Keychain resolver, mandatory approved-host-policy and privacy-safe mapper inputs, injected TCP/DNS and network-settings seams, and a bridge-backed M1 packet plane. The deterministic SPM harness implements the same candidate-neutral `TunnelRuntimeFactory` without a production-manifest bypass.
